 ## Quickstart
 
+New projects use the declared `owner` as their lowercase GitHub-owner RAPPID namespace and mint a UUIDv4 identity once. Existing projects retain their recorded identity; opening or resuming a store never rewrites historical identities. An explicitly supplied Python API `entropy` value must be 16 UUIDv4 bytes, not a name or arbitrary seed.
+
 ```bash
 git clone https://github.com/kody-w/rapp-projects
 cd rapp-projects
